{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Iterator"]},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/init()"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/makeAsyncIterator()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/makeSubscription()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(completion:)"]},{"title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Completion"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Subscribing","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Subscribing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a ","type":"text"},{"code":"for try await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" loop over the subject","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. From then on, every value sent is buffered for that consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until it is consumed, so a consumer that is slower than the sender still sees every value, in order.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Values sent while there are no subscribers are discarded; they are never replayed to a later consumer."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Starting a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"type":"text","text":" that iterates the subject does not mean it has subscribed yet. If values must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not be missed, subscribe before starting it: make the iterator now and hand it to the consumer as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncIteratorSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncIteratorSequence(subject.makeAsyncIterator())"},{"type":"text","text":"). Or wait until the consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has subscribed before sending, for example with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cancelling a task waiting for the subject’s next value ends that consumer’s subscription; values sent afterwards","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not delivered to it. To read the subject again, make a new iterator.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let subject = PassthroughSubject<Int>()","let subscribed = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","","subject.send(0) \/\/ No subscribers yet, so this value is discarded.","","Task {","    for try await value in subject.handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator: { try? subscribed.send() }) {","        print(\"Received value: \\(value)\") \/\/ prints 1, then 2","    }","}","","try await subscribed.execute()","subject.send(1)","subject.send(2)","subject.send(completion: .finished)"]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"title":"PassthroughSubject","modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"externalID":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PassthroughSubject.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject.swift#L45"},"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PassthroughSubject"},{"type":"text","text":" does not retain the most recent value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject."}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncIteratorSequence":{"title":"AsyncIteratorSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncIteratorSequence","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asynciteratorsequence","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncIteratorSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncIteratorSequence","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject":{"title":"PassthroughSubject","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"code":"CurrentValueSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"PassthroughSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not retain the most recent value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject/Completion":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject\/completion","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Completion"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the completion event of a subject, which can either succeed or fail with an error."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Completion"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Completion","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PassthroughSubject.Completion","role":"symbol"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject/makeSubscription()":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"makeSubscription"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SubjectSubscription","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent19SubjectSubscriptionV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject\/makesubscription()","abstract":[{"text":"Subscribes a new consumer that keeps its place when a wait for the next value is cancelled. Values sent from now on are buffered for it until it reads them.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/makeSubscription()","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"makeSubscription()"},"doc://Afluent/Sci":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci","title":"_Concurrency.AsyncSequence"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject/send(completion:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"send","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P